Description:Your Hill Giant (3/3), enchanted with Lure, is attacking. You control two Mountains, and have Pyroclasm in hand. The opponent controls three Centaur Coursers (3/3). End the turn with all three Centaur Coursers in the opponent's graveyard.
Rule:cranial-insertion-adf5a24808a46a8d | Since Foundations an attacker blocked by several creatures divides its combat damage among them freely (CR 510.1c); 1 to each of three 3/3s lets Pyroclasm finish all of them
